{"name": "Showrunners", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Showrunners is a fast paced, single player, speed running platformer focused on building up and maintaining high speeds, performing tricks and mastering the use of movement to achieve the fastest time and greatest score. Find and unlock new movement options to help you escape the gameshow you are trapped in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259450/extras/7b948fe933e95e808f8f730a16139ea3.poster.avif?t=1787228081\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259450/extras/7b948fe933e95e808f8f730a16139ea3.webm?t=1787228081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259450/extras/7b948fe933e95e808f8f730a16139ea3.mp4?t=1787228081\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build up speed and race across a variety of unique and challenging levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259450/extras/c90d0c0a6ca7d8a121e94dbdfdc1d58a.poster.avif?t=1787228081\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259450/extras/c90d0c0a6ca7d8a121e94dbdfdc1d58a.webm?t=1787228081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259450/extras/c90d0c0a6ca7d8a121e94dbdfdc1d58a.mp4?t=1787228081\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your skating skills to find the fastest routes, replay levels to get the fastest time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259450/extras/4fff48c59ae6c4ab58c73e7e2e289b15.poster.avif?t=1787228081\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259450/extras/4fff48c59ae6c4ab58c73e7e2e289b15.webm?t=1787228081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259450/extras/4fff48c59ae6c4ab58c73e7e2e289b15.mp4?t=1787228081\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Score highly in audience approval and become the greatest of all time though the use of flashy tricks and perfect execution.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259450/extras/fd98ff8b22cec6ac989dce08addc57d6.poster.avif?t=1787228081\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259450/extras/fd98ff8b22cec6ac989dce08addc57d6.webm?t=1787228081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259450/extras/fd98ff8b22cec6ac989dce08addc57d6.mp4?t=1787228081\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and collect hidden tickets in every level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259450/extras/9857e34aaa8c11aa7b9cfada0e5f8f1d.poster.avif?t=1787228081\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259450/extras/9857e34aaa8c11aa7b9cfada0e5f8f1d.webm?t=1787228081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259450/extras/9857e34aaa8c11aa7b9cfada0e5f8f1d.mp4?t=1787228081\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the tickets you have accumulated to buy powerful new movement upgrades allowing you to achieve even faster times or new fancy outfits to look stylish while you skate.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 30 handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">multiple unlockable movement upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collectable tickets that can be exchanged for outfits for Sasha</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A ghost player that records your fastest times to race against</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "A single player, fast paced, speed running platformer focused on building up and maintaining high speeds, performing tricks and mastering the use of movement to achieve the fastest time and greatest score. Find and unlock new movement options to help you escape the gameshow you are trapped in.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259450/0fcaa061536fac6f63ec956351335f700f36376f/header.jpg?t=1787228081", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "3D Platformer", "Adventure", "Parkour", "Fast-Paced", "Platformer"], "developers": "Mothlight St